							{
								"box": {
									"code": "// Render pix (f_tf_smooth): passthrough. The state pix owns the feedback\n// computation; this node only surfaces its output to the module outlet and\n// the visible draw, the two-domain f_vf_advect wiring (plan ADR-2). Kept as\n// a separate gen file (not folded into the state codebox) because the state\n// pix's outlet also feeds the feedback loop; separating \"compute\" from\n// \"present\" keeps the outlet independent of the feedback node's own timing,\n// same shape as f_vf_advect's pass/state pair. No params, no clamps, no\n// decode -- the raw tensor passes through untouched.\nout1 = sample(in1, norm);   // inline access (stored-variable .x silent-fails)",
